{
  "schema": "doc-card/v1",
  "code": "NL10.2",
  "chapter": "NL10",
  "title": "P1 单元刚度矩阵",
  "src": {
    "file": "notebook/math/survey/p9-discrete.tex",
    "sha256": "sha256:5feb96646ad1dab0c6f040977bf978cb2715fb208fc65fc40ecf66cb81654cc3"
  },
  "notebook_commit": "3ab7903ff2a4acfea50b71c4930b18b8275c386f",
  "notebook_dirty": false,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "NL10.2:body.s01",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "是什么",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "1D：$K_e=\\frac1h\\begin{bmatrix}1&-1\\\\-1&1\\end{bmatrix}$；\n2D 直角三角形：$K_e=\\frac12\\begin{bmatrix}2&-1&-1\\\\-1&1&0\\\\-1&0&1\\end{bmatrix}$。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL10.2:body.s02",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "为什么需要",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "它是「$-\\Delta$ 在分片线性空间上的矩阵表示」，整个有限元就是从它装配出来的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL10.2:body.s03",
      "type": "proof",
      "title": "关键结论",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "两个必查性质：**行和为 0**（常函数在核里，对应「常数不影响梯度」）、\n**对称**（因为双线性形式对称）。成立条件：P1（分片线性）基函数；单元几何规则。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL10.2:body.s04",
      "type": "proof",
      "title": "判据",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "1D $n=3,h=0.5$：$A=\\frac1h\\begin{bmatrix}1&-1&0\\\\-1&2&-1\\\\0&-1&1\\end{bmatrix}$ 逐项对拍；\n$A(i,j)=A(j,i)$ 要求浮点**精确**相等（同一条装配路径算两次）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL10.2:body.s05",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "前置",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "F1。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL10.2:body.s06",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "常见误解",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "以为「2D 的 $K_e$ 是 1D 的张量积」。直角三角形的 $K_e$ 不是矩形元的张量积形式；\n用错会得到与解析解不符的收敛阶。"
    }
  ],
